The criterion expects zero matches in the six swept files. That grep will still match:
- the two quoted alias keys in `statusNormalizer.ts` (lines 9 and 13), which the design says must stay literal;
- `types.ts:269` (`SliceStatus`), because the grep only excludes `types.ts:[3-6]:`;
- the comment at `ConsistencyChecker.ts:514`.

The criterion is satisfiable only if the grep excludes these explicitly. Define the expected residue per file.
